{"schema":1,"docId":"constitution","locale":"zh","contentVersion":"legal-lab-2026-10-15.2","id":1,"start":64,"units":[{"id":"constitution-uf320536edf33465962-1","sectionId":"constitution-s18","locator":"第14条","text":"第14条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3655bfcee47bf17d80f9ddbf47d99b3ab4139fde/","label":"第14条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4fac86b484213b96c5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s18","locator":"第14条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦是世俗国家。任何宗教均不得被确立为国教或强制信奉的宗教。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3655bfcee47bf17d80f9ddbf47d99b3ab4139fde/","label":"第1款 第14条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u961206ecbcf14e3b54-1","sectionId":"constitution-s18","locator":"第14条","text":"2. 宗教团体与国家分离，在法律面前一律平等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3655bfcee47bf17d80f9ddbf47d99b3ab4139fde/","label":"第2款 第14条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub5485ccbfa6e91b1b7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s19","locator":"第15条","text":"第15条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/54dd4e1f61e0b8fa47bff695f0c08b192a95f7a3/","label":"第15条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ue39197fbbb8a944d9b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s19","locator":"第15条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦宪法具有最高法律效力和直接效力，适用于俄罗斯联邦全境。在俄罗斯联邦通过的法律和其他法律文件不得与俄罗斯联邦宪法相抵触。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/54dd4e1f61e0b8fa47bff695f0c08b192a95f7a3/","label":"第1款 第15条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u80dcdae3557e55e2e7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s19","locator":"第15条","text":"2. 国家权力机关、地方自治机关、公职人员、公民及其团体必须遵守俄罗斯联邦宪法和法律。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/54dd4e1f61e0b8fa47bff695f0c08b192a95f7a3/","label":"第2款 第15条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0fef294ef47d45beb0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s19","locator":"第15条","text":"3. 法律应正式公布。未经公布的法律不予适用。任何涉及人和公民的权利、自由和义务的规范性法律文件，未经正式公布使公众知悉，不得适用。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/54dd4e1f61e0b8fa47bff695f0c08b192a95f7a3/","label":"第3款 第15条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uea03a1eec2fa881485-1","sectionId":"constitution-s19","locator":"第15条","text":"4. 公认的国际法原则和准则以及俄罗斯联邦的国际条约，是其法律体系的组成部分。俄罗斯联邦国际条约规定的规则与法律规定不同时，适用国际条约的规则。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/54dd4e1f61e0b8fa47bff695f0c08b192a95f7a3/","label":"第4款 第15条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u79b13c640cda85e23a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s20","locator":"第16条","text":"第16条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e9798c10296ef2951f99b8c4ad4064a3880819b6/","label":"第16条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-uee3a10b6265626dc10-1","sectionId":"constitution-s20","locator":"第16条","text":"1. 宪法本章规定构成俄罗斯联邦宪法制度的基础，只能依本宪法规定的程序变更。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e9798c10296ef2951f99b8c4ad4064a3880819b6/","label":"第1款 第16条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u951dc75cfe199afcaf-1","sectionId":"constitution-s20","locator":"第16条","text":"2. 本宪法任何其他规定均不得与俄罗斯联邦宪法制度的基础相抵触。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e9798c10296ef2951f99b8c4ad4064a3880819b6/","label":"第2款 第16条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua92fbd518dc5b76d76-1","sectionId":"constitution-s21","locator":"第2章 人和公民的权利与自由","text":"第2章 人和公民的权利与自由","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/663b1f72ac99492b2ce694326b5446adf70f47fa/","label":"第2章 人和公民的权利与自由","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u2ef043dc7a1531dd5b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s22","locator":"第17条","text":"第17条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d94e831070f1b26a082b3517d51e9e4c348fc419/","label":"第17条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud9f585f7a895356270-1","sectionId":"constitution-s22","locator":"第17条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦依照公认的国际法原则和准则及本宪法，承认并保障人和公民的权利与自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d94e831070f1b26a082b3517d51e9e4c348fc419/","label":"第1款 第17条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf4d27a33eb70cb4779-1","sectionId":"constitution-s22","locator":"第17条","text":"2. 人的基本权利与自由不可剥夺，人人自出生起享有。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d94e831070f1b26a082b3517d51e9e4c348fc419/","label":"第2款 第17条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud7aaa7d7d0d23a0c95-1","sectionId":"constitution-s22","locator":"第17条","text":"3. 行使人和公民的权利与自由，不得侵犯他人的权利与自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d94e831070f1b26a082b3517d51e9e4c348fc419/","label":"第3款 第17条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc31a46a7743b4f8d2f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s23","locator":"第18条","text":"第18条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3d601956a40c421d1a01bd454636753478105a7a/","label":"第18条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u2c079cf4585762f1dc-1","sectionId":"constitution-s23","locator":"第18条","text":"人和公民的权利与自由具有直接效力。它们决定法律的意义、内容和适用，决定立法权、行政权和地方自治的活动，并由司法保障。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/3d601956a40c421d1a01bd454636753478105a7a/","label":"第18条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u20144f88923c3d35b0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s24","locator":"第19条","text":"第19条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a4d26fe6022253f9f9e396e9ca6f63c80946702f/","label":"第19条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud6912bd1d600e3ac5b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s24","locator":"第19条","text":"1. 人人在法律和法院面前一律平等。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a4d26fe6022253f9f9e396e9ca6f63c80946702f/","label":"第1款 第19条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u213823fe263582937b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s24","locator":"第19条","text":"2. 国家保障人和公民的权利与自由平等，不因性别、种族、民族、语言、出身、财产状况和职务地位、居住地、宗教态度、信念、社会团体成员身份或其他情况而有区别。禁止以社会、种族、民族、语言或宗教归属为由，以任何形式限制公民权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a4d26fe6022253f9f9e396e9ca6f63c80946702f/","label":"第2款 第19条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u11099d808c0b9b6131-1","sectionId":"constitution-s24","locator":"第19条","text":"3. 男女享有平等的权利与自由，并享有实现这些权利与自由的平等机会。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a4d26fe6022253f9f9e396e9ca6f63c80946702f/","label":"第3款 第19条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ufa000ca030fa3b4529-1","sectionId":"constitution-s25","locator":"第20条","text":"第20条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/cfd4c7fbccee877fc92795ed610afe6ed05de7c8/","label":"第20条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u987bd80b27318129a9-1","sectionId":"constitution-s25","locator":"第20条","text":"1. 人人享有生命权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/cfd4c7fbccee877fc92795ed610afe6ed05de7c8/","label":"第1款 第20条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud3bdeb85bd1ea397fd-1","sectionId":"constitution-s25","locator":"第20条","text":"2. 在死刑废除之前，联邦法律可以将死刑规定为对侵犯生命的特别严重犯罪的特殊刑罚，但须赋予被告人由有陪审员参与的法院审理其案件的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/cfd4c7fbccee877fc92795ed610afe6ed05de7c8/","label":"第2款 第20条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u538add7ff5a4f7e328-1","sectionId":"constitution-s26","locator":"第21条","text":"第21条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e7fbd40d5c89c3066eab2473bcaac30880b58eb3/","label":"第21条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u511699c8838e42f165-1","sectionId":"constitution-s26","locator":"第21条","text":"1. 人格尊严受国家保护。任何情况均不得成为贬损人格尊严的依据。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e7fbd40d5c89c3066eab2473bcaac30880b58eb3/","label":"第1款 第21条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u78969f58576b845e1d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s26","locator":"第21条","text":"2. 任何人不得遭受酷刑、暴力或其他残忍或有辱人格尊严的待遇或处罚。未经本人自愿同意，不得对任何人进行医学、科学或其他试验。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e7fbd40d5c89c3066eab2473bcaac30880b58eb3/","label":"第2款 第21条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5970966e1fce71706f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s27","locator":"第22条","text":"第22条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2255a7b5ec966256ad533121186923d4cb1580d2/","label":"第22条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud3db0616a7b09dfed6-1","sectionId":"constitution-s27","locator":"第22条","text":"1. 人人享有人身自由和人身不受侵犯的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2255a7b5ec966256ad533121186923d4cb1580d2/","label":"第1款 第22条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6d85dbf59d1c36d78e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s27","locator":"第22条","text":"2. 逮捕、羁押和继续羁押，只能经法院决定实施。在法院作出决定之前，对个人的拘留不得超过48小时。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2255a7b5ec966256ad533121186923d4cb1580d2/","label":"第2款 第22条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u108c3f1b101d78dd42-1","sectionId":"constitution-s28","locator":"第23条","text":"第23条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2573feee1caecac37c442734e00215bbf1c85248/","label":"第23条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-uea56f3a18df5e6ecd2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s28","locator":"第23条","text":"1. 人人享有私人生活不受侵犯、个人和家庭秘密受到保护以及维护本人荣誉和名誉的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2573feee1caecac37c442734e00215bbf1c85248/","label":"第1款 第23条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua9c33f4156967ec4ca-1","sectionId":"constitution-s28","locator":"第23条","text":"2. 人人享有书信、电话交谈、邮政、电报及其他通信秘密的权利。只有依据法院决定，方可限制这一权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2573feee1caecac37c442734e00215bbf1c85248/","label":"第2款 第23条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2dd352f5b0fe9d93ef-1","sectionId":"constitution-s29","locator":"第24条","text":"第24条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/bcddbd9060e44ed6085b65a1af0fb90aa3ef0175/","label":"第24条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u2e7e56ee5dc03d7593-1","sectionId":"constitution-s29","locator":"第24条","text":"1. 未经本人同意，不得收集、储存、使用和传播有关其私人生活的信息。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/bcddbd9060e44ed6085b65a1af0fb90aa3ef0175/","label":"第1款 第24条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6a8eb5d0185dd0b1fb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s29","locator":"第24条","text":"2. 国家权力机关、地方自治机关及其公职人员，必须保障每个人查阅直接涉及其权利与自由的文件和资料的机会，法律另有规定的除外。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/bcddbd9060e44ed6085b65a1af0fb90aa3ef0175/","label":"第2款 第24条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9e0488352fefae5711-1","sectionId":"constitution-s30","locator":"第25条","text":"第25条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ed0b829604f79a6e37a7e1aa152b243656e82949/","label":"第25条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4b42a420b4318fceff-1","sectionId":"constitution-s30","locator":"第25条","text":"住宅不受侵犯。除联邦法律规定的情形或依据法院决定外，任何人无权违背居住者意愿进入其住宅。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ed0b829604f79a6e37a7e1aa152b243656e82949/","label":"第25条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uba7da02d962061110d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s31","locator":"第26条","text":"第26条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/888dfbab0d30dc4692a0e81927a10ee64682aabd/","label":"第26条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u6eb0d1cef0206858aa-1","sectionId":"constitution-s31","locator":"第26条","text":"1. 人人有权确定和表明自己的民族归属。不得强迫任何人确定或表明自己的民族归属。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/888dfbab0d30dc4692a0e81927a10ee64682aabd/","label":"第1款 第26条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u4de974f0335d977296-1","sectionId":"constitution-s31","locator":"第26条","text":"2. 人人享有使用母语的权利，有权自由选择交往、养育、教育和创作所用的语言。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/888dfbab0d30dc4692a0e81927a10ee64682aabd/","label":"第2款 第26条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udaa31c009bcc3e5423-1","sectionId":"constitution-s32","locator":"第27条","text":"第27条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1a349c9b47bf7c4104137be732fbc8640d1b81de/","label":"第27条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4b3cd8dee203abd0fa-1","sectionId":"constitution-s32","locator":"第27条","text":"1. 合法处于俄罗斯联邦境内的每个人，都有权自由迁徙并选择停留地和居住地。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1a349c9b47bf7c4104137be732fbc8640d1b81de/","label":"第1款 第27条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud44d551317669bf228-1","sectionId":"constitution-s32","locator":"第27条","text":"2. 人人可以自由离开俄罗斯联邦。俄罗斯联邦公民有权不受阻碍地返回俄罗斯联邦。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1a349c9b47bf7c4104137be732fbc8640d1b81de/","label":"第2款 第27条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2e0c8937665f02b208-1","sectionId":"constitution-s33","locator":"第28条","text":"第28条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/69de606a34754e42f0767090ca6c640885cdf63d/","label":"第28条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u7e1ae9d3f529048a19-1","sectionId":"constitution-s33","locator":"第28条","text":"保障人人享有良心自由和信仰自由，包括单独或与他人共同信奉任何宗教或不信奉任何宗教，自由选择、持有和传播宗教及其他信念，并依此行事的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/69de606a34754e42f0767090ca6c640885cdf63d/","label":"第28条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue4d9c4c04c675432e0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"第29条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第29条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-uc0c41038b6f2107ff4-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"1. 保障人人享有思想和言论自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第1款 第29条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u3b539e8cbd5a9859a3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"2. 不得进行煽动社会、种族、民族或宗教仇恨和敌意的宣传或鼓动。禁止宣传社会、种族、民族、宗教或语言优越论。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第2款 第29条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ub62c783603ec499773-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"3. 不得强迫任何人表达或放弃自己的意见和信念。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第3款 第29条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2ecbefdc5243ab2179-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"4. 人人有权以任何合法方式自由寻找、获取、传递、制作和传播信息。属于国家秘密的信息目录由联邦法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第4款 第29条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u76122b94b69f2f7355-1","sectionId":"constitution-s34","locator":"第29条","text":"5. 保障大众传播自由。禁止审查制度。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/f703218d9357338507052de484404828b3da468e/","label":"第5款 第29条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u06dfa7002309b1d866-1","sectionId":"constitution-s35","locator":"第30条","text":"第30条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2fd1c7c9b207640443093237e96f505e64cbc197/","label":"第30条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud058613aed93085284-1","sectionId":"constitution-s35","locator":"第30条","text":"1. 人人享有结社权，包括为保护自身利益而建立工会的权利。保障社会团体活动自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2fd1c7c9b207640443093237e96f505e64cbc197/","label":"第1款 第30条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uab00d1608c08491aea-1","sectionId":"constitution-s35","locator":"第30条","text":"2. 不得强迫任何人加入或留在任何团体。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2fd1c7c9b207640443093237e96f505e64cbc197/","label":"第2款 第30条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u287d083448033555d7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s36","locator":"第31条","text":"第31条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/bb71a77fd379bb39d3105930d245a274df7c5656/","label":"第31条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u0832d9176ceb41fa3f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s36","locator":"第31条","text":"俄罗斯联邦公民有权和平且不携带武器地集会，举行会议、群众集会、示威、游行和纠察。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/bb71a77fd379bb39d3105930d245a274df7c5656/","label":"第31条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u62976b2ff182ee8ffe-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"第32条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第32条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u2f65d6489a4dc45b50-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"1. 俄罗斯联邦公民有权直接或通过代表参与管理国家事务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第1款 第32条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8f3fef806d520b79b3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦公民享有国家权力机关和地方自治机关的选举权和被选举权，并有权参加全民公决。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第2款 第32条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ued0c0022c6732723c3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"3. 被法院认定为无行为能力的公民，以及依法院判决在剥夺自由场所服刑的公民，不享有选举权和被选举权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第3款 第32条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc85349640799d42bf7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"4. 俄罗斯联邦公民享有平等进入国家公务的机会。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第4款 第32条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc70b8482ce75f7dd37-1","sectionId":"constitution-s37","locator":"第32条","text":"5. 俄罗斯联邦公民有权参与司法审判。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/eee7816f1f62b8c67e2aec7c027886cf20d17c37/","label":"第5款 第32条","heading":false}]}
